abstract: >-
  Public code for Bayesian GBM volatility inference, one-factor arithmetic Asian
  option pricing, Curran approximation and synthetic posterior-integration
  experiments, including historical ten-million-history aggregate summaries.
  Licensed market data and a complete empirical study reproduction are excluded.
